	"name": "Larian’s Environmental Disturbance",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/earth/barrier-stone-brown-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As an action, you can cast a damaging cantrip at the ground to create difficult terrain. Cantrips create a 5ft radius patch of difficult terrain per dice of damage. Cold damage cantrips may create an ice slick, while flaming cantrips create a searing and burnt area. Acid and poison cantrips typically create a caustic mire of mud. A necrotic cantrip could cause skeletal or ghostly hands to try to trip or grab at creatures moving through the area, and so forth.</p>",
